OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'repeatedly preyed' on girl
OL,4,Aover Snapchat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "predator" who sent sexually explicit
OL,7,Fmessages to a girl over Snapchat to try
OL,8,Fto persuade her to share intimate
OL,9,Fphotos of herself, has been jailed
OL,11,FJason Payne, 37, of Station Road,
OL,12,FCalne, pleaded guilty to sexual
OL,13,Fcommunications with a child and witness
OL,14,Fintimidation on 8 July at Swindon Crown
OL,15,FCourt.
OL,17,FChristopher Wright, from Wiltshire
OL,18,FPolice's Volume Crime Team, said Payne
OL,19,Fnot only "repeatedly preyed on the
OL,20,Fvictim" but also tried to pressure her
OL,21,Fand her family into retracting their
OL,22,Fevidence.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
